  "sourceAssignment": "Completion 156 Lunar Gallery exclusively uses ten original families in order: abc-part1, then lunar-gallery-part1 through part9. Full disjoint source windows include ABC discovery/navigation, level entry, every constructor move, the HOT detour and skull melt, wall pushes, rule-breaking exit and complete victory-to-pause tail. These navigation families are not allocated to a separate hunt. All originals and sidecars remain retained.",
  "scope": "The letter-built MOON IS BABA rule converted the divider moon into a second controlled Baba. The bodies later overlapped; the HOT detour melted a DEFEAT/MELT skull and left a visible surviving Baba, with stacked survivor count uncertain. NOT BABA IS PUSH made walls movable. The east wall was pushed outward twice, PUSH was then moved down to break that rule, and Baba exited to the outside flag. The settled map/pause verifies ABC 1/4, completion 156 and nine flowers.",
